WEBVTT

00:00:01.104 --> 00:00:07.071
Type your bank's name in the Name box

00:00:07.071 --> 00:00:14.168
Select Search

00:00:14.168 --> 00:00:23.539
Check the city and state, then select View Details

00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:29.275
Open the Financials tab

00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:35.072
Select Financial Reporting

00:00:35.072 --> 00:00:43.696
Select your bank's name again to open its reports

00:00:43.696 --> 00:00:48.791
Copy the report date, shown after "Data as of"

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:53.377
Set Report Type to Summary Table

00:00:53.377 --> 00:00:57.871
Select Generate Report

00:00:57.871 --> 00:01:02.523
Open 3. Balance Sheet

00:01:02.523 --> 00:01:13.605
Copy Securities, Total Assets, Total Deposits and Total Equity Capital

00:01:13.605 --> 00:01:21.384
Open 4. Performance Ratios and copy Net Interest Margin

00:01:21.384 --> 00:01:30.074
Open 5. Condition Ratios and copy Leverage (Core Capital) Ratio

00:01:30.074 --> 00:01:34.649
Set Report Type to Assets, Liabilities, and Capital

00:01:34.649 --> 00:01:39.171
Select Generate Report

00:01:39.171 --> 00:01:50.605
Open 4. Total Liabilities and Capital, then Total Liabilities, then Deposits held in Domestic Offices

00:01:50.605 --> 00:01:56.426
Copy % Insured (Estimated)
